      "text": "[7:33PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nUnimpeded traffic flow observed on Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja GRA, as well as fluid movement in and out of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\nSmooth traffic progression currently on Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge.\nEfficient vehicular movement along the service lane of Anthony Way, facilitating unhindered inward and outward journeys from Maryland Intersection to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, respectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
