      "text": "[7:43PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdekunle to Unilag Waterfront and down to Ilaje, inward-bound to Iyana Oworo is smooth. \nReturn journey from Iyana Oworo to Adekunle is good.\nIyana Oworo inw Olopo-Meji, down to Gbagada, inward-bound to Charly Boy, and return journey is also good.\n\nGridlock-free movement from Deeper Life to New Garage and Baale.\nSmooth traffic towards Muritala, down to Bariga Roundabout.\nFluid movement towards Ilaje Chemist Bus Stop, down to Pako, Unilag Gate, and Abule Oja.\nSmooth return journey from Unilag Gate to Baale.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
