      "text": "[8:14PM] #Mile12 #TrafficUpdate \n\nAppreciable movement from Iyana School inward Kosofe, down to Mile 12.\nAscending and descending Mile 12 Bridge, inward-bound to Owode Elede, Owode Onirin, Weigh Bridge, Idera, Irawo, Thomas, Ajegunle, and down to Odo Ogun is good.\n\nReturn journey from Odo Ogun back to Owode Onirin, down to Mile 12 is smooth.\nSmooth navigation through the underpass of Mile 12 Bridge, inward-bound to Ajelogo.\n\nBetter movement ascending and descending Mile 12 Bridge, inward-bound to Kosofe, down to Iyana School.\nUnder Mile 12 Bridge, inward-bound to Main Market is also better. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
