      "text": "[8PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nFluid traffic progression observed on CMS Bridge, facilitating a smooth inw Offin Canal Market.\nUnimpeded movement on Eko Bridge, inward-bound to Ijora Olopa Intersection.\nEfficient vehicular flow on Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, seamlessly connecting to Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo.\nSmooth traffic connectivity from Eko Bridge, inward-bound to Apongbon, and subsequently to key destinations including CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, Ebute-Ero Market, Leventist, and both inner and outer Marina.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
