      "text": "[8:41PM]  #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nAppreciable movement on Lagos-Ibadan Expressway (in and out).\nBetter movement at Isheri Olowora to Omole Junction, including River Valley, Kosoko, VIS, Grammar School, and Excellence.\nTowards Yaya Abatan, connecting Kayode, Caterpillar, Odo Eran, and Wempco (both inbound and outbound) is better.\nGood movement from Wempco to Lateef Jakande, connecting to Omole Junction, Omole Gate, VIS, Kosoko, River Valley, and Isheri Olowora\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
